= gruener literaler Compile-Beleg (faengt Metaprog-/Routing-Fehler).\n+ CMake-Target (COMDARE_MEASUREMENT_ON zwingend, sonst kein IObservableTier/Segment-Timing-\nCompile; voller ADHOC-Include-Satz wie m3v2_pmc_smoke) + contract:pool_flip-CI-Job (analog\ncontract:conformance).\n\nCodex SHIP (kein BLOCKER). NIT = bekannte DEG-1 (Pool-seg_ns-Key-Ernte faellt auf Key 0,\nabi_adapter.hpp:1303/1313) — bewusst out-of-scope dieses Compile-Gates -\u003e #233. Deckt Teil\nvon #230 (Adapter-Instanziierung erstmals CI-compile-gegatet).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","author_name":"Benjamin-Elias Probst","author_email":"benjamineliasprobst@gmail.com","authored_date":"2026-07-01T20:31:16.000+02:00","committer_name":"Benjamin-Elias Probst","committer_email":"benjamineliasprobst@gmail.com","committed_date":"2026-07-01T20:31:16.000+02:00","trailers":{},"extended_trailers":{},"web_url":"https://gitlab.comdare.de/comdare/research/comdare-cache-engine/-/commit/d8c2599e7272bf2490b19ff9e3d10c3dc750f09c"},"pipeline":{"id":7369,"iid":239,"project_id":286,"sha":"d8c2599e7272bf2490b19ff9e3d10c3dc750f09c","ref":"main","status":"failed","source":"push","created_at":"2026-07-01T18:31:44.636Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T18:50:31.691Z","web_url":"https://gitlab.comdare.de/comdare/research/comdare-cache-engine/-/pipelines/7369"},"web_url":"https://gitlab.comdare.de/comdare/research/comdare-cache-engine/-/jobs/191772","project":{"ci_job_token_scope_enabled":false},"artifacts":[],"runner":{"id":16,"description":"prod-baremetal-prod1","ip_address":null,"active":true,"paused":false,"is_shared":true,"runner_type":"instance_type","name":null,"online":true,"created_by":{"id":1,"username":"root","public_email":null,"name":"Administrator","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/cda9ed339d5b94a8b88b886590d2618a3812352a04a9b5f27d1df736a4cde221?s=80\u0026d=identicon","web_url":"https://gitlab.comdare.de/root"},"creat